usage: run_pr70_quadrature_diagnostic.py [-h] [--task {run,verify}]
                                         [--profile {smoke,full}]
                                         [--expected-sha EXPECTED_SHA]
                                         [--evidence-root EVIDENCE_ROOT]
                                         [--feature-reference FEATURE_REFERENCE]
                                         [--output OUTPUT] [--input INPUT]

Offline quadrature diagnostic on pinned PR70 prefixes, NEVER new BO trials.
Load the original numerical VAE checkpoint, refit only prefix GP heads,
require four-node replay agreement, then change quadrature nodes at the SAME
state. All true evaluators and VAE training methods are blocked during
reconstruction. R1 attests the original two source hashes and binds ONLY the
temporary replay problem to their independently reconstructed historical
contract. No source or record bytes are rewritten, and all original
reconstruction tests remain.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --task {run,verify}
  --profile {smoke,full}
  --expected-sha EXPECTED_SHA
  --evidence-root EVIDENCE_ROOT
  --feature-reference FEATURE_REFERENCE
  --output OUTPUT
  --input INPUT
EXIT=0
